  "description": "This receipt is a thermal point-of-sale (POS) receipt issued by Noesaka PIK, located at Land's End PIK 2, Unit L9-2 No. 15, Indonesia. The receipt header includes the restaurant name, branch location, telephone number, guest count (Pax), dining section/table identifier, cashier name (SILVI), POS terminal identifier, receipt number, and transaction date and time. The lower section contains a financial summary showing Subtotal, SC 7.5% (Service Charge), PB1 (restaurant tax), and the Total amount due. The footer includes a customer appreciation message (\"Thank you, See you again!\"), followed by a PreSettlement Bill designation and a final timestamp. This is a standard Indonesian restaurant POS receipt formatted as a pre-settlement bill prior to final payment.",
